ow 1 | $2$ | {{field-1}} | $2$ |\n| Row 2 | $2$ | $-2$ | {{field-2}} |\n| Row 3 | {{field-3}} | $-1$ | $-1$ |\n" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products. The supplied entries and the missing entries all follow this rule.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= 1\\cdot2+0\\cdot1+2\\cdot0 = 2 \\\\ c_{12} &= 1\\cdot1+0\\cdot(-1)+2\\cdot2 = 5 \\\\ c_{13} &= 1\\cdot0+0\\cdot2+2\\cdot1 = 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= 0\\cdot2+2\\cdot1+0\\cdot0 = 2 \\\\ c_{22} &= 0\\cdot1+2\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot2 = -2 \\\\ c_{23} &= 0\\cdot0+2\\cdot2+0\\cdot1 = 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 1\\cdot2+0\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot0 = 2 \\\\ c_{32} &= 1\\cdot1+0\\cdot(-1)+(-1)\\cdot2 = -1 \\\\ c_{33} &= 1\\cdot0+0\\cdot2+(-1)\\cdot1 = -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186695559 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4d76433-0f4a-5ce1-a0a9-d945d629efd9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4d76433-0f4a-5ce1-a0a9-d945d629efd9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695557} :answer-field/id #uuid "65c0bf5b-c79d-5d93-b3de-e062c807409d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695538} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d9a1e04-dc7a-5934-b957-614cc7b46e4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695534}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d9a1e04-dc7a-5934-b957-614cc7b46e4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695534} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c43286d-f536-54b5-86a8-907195eac27b" :answer-field/key "field-9" :answer-field/type