tion/id #uuid "4c3edcf4-cab2-5f5b-8f4d-2a91ff1eaac8" :question/problem "Calculate $AB$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$-7$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$-6$</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$3$</td><td>$-18$</td><td>{{field-5}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= (-3)\\cdot(-2)+(-2)\\cdot0+1\\cdot(-1) = 5 \\\\ c_{12} &= (-3)\\cdot3+(-2)\\cdot3+1\\cdot3 = -12 \\\\ c_{13} &= (-3)\\cdot0+(-2)\\cdot3+1\\cdot(-1) = -7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= (-3)\\cdot(-2)+0\\cdot0+1\\cdot(-1) = 5 \\\\ c_{22} &= (-3)\\cdot3+0\\cdot3+1\\cdot3 = -6 \\\\ c_{23} &= (-3)\\cdot0+0\\cdot3+1\\cdot(-1) = -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 0\\cdot(-2)+(-3)\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot(-1) = 3 \\\\ c_{32} &= 0\\cdot3+(-3)\\cdot3+(-3)\\cdot3 = -18 \\\\ c_{33} &= 0\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot3+(-3)\\cdot(-1) = -6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -12 & -7 \\\\ 5 & -6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -18 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186695745 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ddd18c8-de68-5b79-95ce-5e902ce18e8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695742}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ddd18c8-de68-5b79-95ce-5e902ce18e8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695742} :answer-field/id #uu