 -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-4}}</td><td>{{field-5}}</td><td>{{field-6}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-7}}</td><td>{{field-8}}</td><td>{{field-9}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= 1\\cdot3+1\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot2 = 4 \\\\ c_{12} &= 1\\cdot1+1\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot(-1) = 3 \\\\ c_{13} &= 1\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot(-3)+(-1)\\cdot(-3) = -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= (-3)\\cdot3+1\\cdot3+(-2)\\cdot2 = -10 \\\\ c_{22} &= (-3)\\cdot1+1\\cdot1+(-2)\\cdot(-1) = 0 \\\\ c_{23} &= (-3)\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot(-3)+(-2)\\cdot(-3) = 6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= (-2)\\cdot3+2\\cdot3+(-1)\\cdot2 = -2 \\\\ c_{32} &= (-2)\\cdot1+2\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot(-1) = 1 \\\\ c_{33} &= (-2)\\cdot(-1)+2\\cdot(-3)+(-1)\\cdot(-3) = -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -10 & 0 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186695823 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dbe323e2-f72d-5c91-a317-3a1c382de2ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695867}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dbe323e2-f72d-5c91-a317-3a1c382de2ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695867} :answer-field/id #uuid "106af1b5-e429-5074-914d-61f410cb8eb3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186695801} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cbadcde-531a-5c86-b018-d9b115afe8cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type